330→// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
331→// EVM Native Balance Delta: DEFERRED
332→// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
333→//
334→// EVM native balance deltas require trace API (debug_traceTransaction or
335→// trace_transaction) data which is not yet stored in Bronze raw_transactions.
336→// The current Bronze model stores log-level data and transaction-level
337→// metadata (value, gas_used, effective_gas_price), but this is insufficient
338→// to compute accurate native balance deltas for all accounts in a transaction:
339→//
340→// - The "value" field only captures the direct ETH transfer.
341→// - Internal transactions (contract-to-contract ETH transfers) are not
342→//   visible without trace data.
343→// - Gas refunds and self-destructs also affect balances.
344→//
345→// When Bronze gains trace API support (e.g. raw_evm_traces table), this
346→// materializer should be implemented. Until then, DatasetName::NativeBalanceDeltas
347→// is not supported for EVM chain family.
348→
